What sets this hypothesis apart: the board game comes off the bookshelf and onto the coffee table; serving dishes and extra plates/glasses are deployed to the kitchen table; the snack bowl is out in the living room; Yuki's guitar is stowed out of the way because the couch is occupied by guests; and the dog bowl may be relocated so the dog isn't underfoot.

